  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Plotting the diagram of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,&nbsp;we get,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0084_bb23600e249a.png\" style=\"width: 301px; height: 180px;\" /></p><p>Area of the region between the two curves</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msubsup><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfen